vsm1.2:29.1:
The benefits are these. He actually practices in conformity with the dependence because of the words “The going forth by depending
on the eating of lumps of alms food” (Vin II 58, 96); he is established in the second of the Noble Ones’ heritages; his existence
is independent of others; it is a requisite recommended by the Blessed One thus “Valueless, easy to get, blameless” (A II 26);
